In particular, the rise of AI-driven financial services is expected to play a significant role in shaping the economic landscape. Financial institutions are increasingly adopting AI for risk management, fraud detection, and personalized customer services. As these technologies become more integrated into everyday financial operations, they are expected to enhance productivity, reduce systemic risks, and foster greater financial inclusion.

